(7720666, 1270422, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like your photo and I like how the moon is framed by the trees/bushes. But if would have benefited quite a bit from cropping, I feel. The bottom third doesn''t add to the photo, neither does the blur on the left. Also, the editing has left it with some very odd lines in the sky. 5 for the photo +1 for the effort.</td>', 'I like your photo and I like how the moon is framed by the trees/bushes. But if would have benefited quite a bit from cropping, I feel. The bottom third doesn''t add to the photo, neither does the blur on the left. Also, the editing has left it with some very odd lines in the sky. 5 for the photo +1 for the effort.', '2022-05-23 19:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7720667, 1270413, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like this. I''m wondering how it would have looked a bit brighter. It seems a tad dark (yes, I know it''s dark out!) but I''m curious what it would look like bumped up just a tad. 6 for the shot +1 for playing.</td>', 'I like this. I''m wondering how it would have looked a bit brighter. It seems a tad dark (yes, I know it''s dark out!) but I''m curious what it would look like bumped up just a tad. 6 for the shot +1 for playing.', '2022-05-23 19:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7720668, 1270432, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok -- the blur is driving me up the wall, but the colors are so wonderful that it''s warring with the blur. 6 for the shot +1 for playing.</td>', 'Ok -- the blur is driving me up the wall, but the colors are so wonderful that it''s warring with the blur. 6 for the shot +1 for playing.', '2022-05-23 19:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7720669, 1270430, 103142, '<td valign="top">Really funky. It looks like it''s the creature that''s trying to eat the moon! 8 for the shot, and +1 for playing. (everyone''s getting +1 for bothering to play the game.)</td>', 'Really funky. It looks like it''s the creature that''s trying to eat the moon! 8 for the shot, and +1 for playing. (everyone''s getting +1 for bothering to play the game.)', '2022-05-23 19:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7720670, 1270421, 103142, '<td valign="top">Yup -- this is one of ths stages that I thought looked like a giant eyeball. Yours really does look like a giant eye ball! The funkiness is pretty cool. 7 for the shot. +1 for playing the game.</td>', 'Yup -- this is one of ths stages that I thought looked like a giant eyeball. Yours really does look like a giant eye ball! The funkiness is pretty cool. 7 for the shot. +1 for playing the game.', '2022-05-23 19:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7720671, 1270405, 103142, '<td valign="top">Really lovely! The only thing I don''t like is the vignetting on the left side. (only because I''m only really seeing it on the left, and not in other areas. 8 for the shot. +1 for playing the game</td>', 'Really lovely! The only thing I don''t like is the vignetting on the left side. (only because I''m only really seeing it on the left, and not in other areas. 8 for the shot. +1 for playing the game', '2022-05-23 19:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
